    HAVE_CHECK_SHA256, HAVE_ENCODER_*/DECODER_*, HAVE_MF_*) so the XZ
    encoder rejected its default CRC64 check (LZMA_OPTIONS_ERROR,
    'Invalid or unsupported options'); the liblzma file walk also excluded
