### VirtualBox test VM (configured 2026-08-18)
- vbox-setup.ps1 fixed for VBox 7.2: `--audio none` is deprecated and its
  stderr warning aborted the script under PS 5.1 `$ErrorActionPreference=Stop`
  (the VM stayed powered off); now uses `--audio-driver none`, and VBox-Exec
  merges stderr and only fails on a real non-zero exit.
- VM 'InterpretiveOS' verified (headless): boots to the M8 shell in ~30s,
  real PS/2 scancodes via `VBoxManage controlvm InterpretiveOS
  keyboardputscancode` compute `1 + 1` -> 2 on serial; display 1280x1024
  VMSVGA, left-to-right (pixel-checked: banner text only on the left,
  bg (18,22,30)); screenshots via `controlvm ... screenshotpng` (6744 B,
  known-good size).  Serial: target/vbox-serial.log.  Stop with
  `VBoxManage controlvm InterpretiveOS poweroff` (the shell's `exit` only
  works under QEMU).